      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a deeply painful time, and those feelings of emptiness and disconnection are incredibly heavy. Please know that these feelings, while overwhelming, do not define who you are. Reaching out for support is a brave first step, and speaking with a mental health professional can provide you with tools and guidance to navigate these difficult emotions. You don't have to go through this alone.",
